WEBVTT

00:00:03.850 --> 00:00:05.900
Here we are.

00:00:06.860 --> 00:00:10.100
Thanks for the ride.

00:00:13.130 --> 00:00:15.110
Come on, I'll lift you out.

00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:26.300
Did you have a twin?

00:00:26.300 --> 00:00:28.190
I've never had a doppelgänger.

00:00:28.190 --> 00:00:29.330
That means...

00:00:32.270 --> 00:00:33.630
Okay, come in.

00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:37.180
It's not messy, but it's cramped.

00:00:41.540 --> 00:00:42.680
Stay away!

00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:53.470
Ah! I bit my tongue.

00:00:53.470 --> 00:00:56.030
Give me a kiss, Mako-kun!

00:00:56.730 --> 00:00:58.460
It was so hot in there.

00:00:58.460 --> 00:01:00.540
I can't believe Erio put up with this.

00:01:00.540 --> 00:01:02.840
It must be dry in there...

00:01:02.840 --> 00:01:03.660
<i>your skin, that is.</i>

00:01:03.660 --> 00:01:08.880
Some people still call me the smooth-skinned sensei!

00:01:08.880 --> 00:01:11.410
Don't read my mind like it's nothing.

00:01:11.410 --> 00:01:13.670
Why are you dressed like that?

00:01:16.780 --> 00:01:19.590
I've turned forty.

00:01:19.590 --> 00:01:21.140
It's sad but true!

00:01:24.680 --> 00:01:30.510
If this episode were never made,
I would've been thirty-nine forever!

00:01:30.510 --> 00:01:33.650
Why must life be so cruel?

00:01:34.720 --> 00:01:37.260
That's why I was pouting about my life.

00:01:39.990 --> 00:01:43.640
And? Where did you two lovebirds sneak off to?

00:01:43.640 --> 00:01:45.290
We just went shopping.

00:01:45.290 --> 00:01:47.030
I see, you went to buy porn mags!

00:01:47.030 --> 00:01:48.670
Don't convince yourself of something I didn't say!

00:01:52.490 --> 00:01:55.680
Happy birthday.

00:01:55.680 --> 00:01:57.790
Oh, thank you.

00:01:57.790 --> 00:02:00.050
But I'm not happy at all!

00:02:03.120 --> 00:02:06.090
I bought some dango.

00:02:06.090 --> 00:02:11.190
Uh... Mom... I love you.

00:02:11.190 --> 00:02:14.030
Oh, my! Eri-chan,

00:02:14.030 --> 00:02:15.070
is that a confession of love?

00:02:17.700 --> 00:02:21.070
Geez! You're just so cute!

00:02:21.940 --> 00:02:25.620
That reminds me. I forgot to celebrate Erio's birthday last year!

00:02:26.170 --> 00:02:28.880
Let's celebrate your birthday tomorrow.

00:02:30.250 --> 00:02:32.380
Would you like to eat some dango?

00:02:32.380 --> 00:02:34.210
I would! I would!

00:02:38.280 --> 00:02:41.350
The Touwa household was noisy,

00:02:41.350 --> 00:02:43.930
but fun in its own way...

00:02:43.930 --> 00:02:47.020
at the cost of my adolescence points.

00:02:52.280 --> 00:02:55.530
Don't look at me, it's embarrassing!

00:04:30.880 --> 00:04:33.610
Niwa-kun. Do you have a part-time job?

00:04:33.610 --> 00:04:37.310
I want to get one eventually.

00:04:38.190 --> 00:04:40.190
Really?

00:04:40.190 --> 00:04:44.720
Then treat me for a drink when you find your first job!

00:04:45.770 --> 00:04:46.700
What about you, Ryuushi-san?

00:04:47.100 --> 00:04:49.200
It's Ryuuko!

00:04:49.200 --> 00:04:52.700
As for me... Probably not.

00:04:52.700 --> 00:04:55.870
My schedule's filled with club activities after school,

00:04:55.870 --> 00:04:57.790
and I don't need money for my hobbies.

00:04:57.790 --> 00:05:02.170
Well, I'm actually a delinquent!

00:05:02.170 --> 00:05:07.450
I may not look like it, but then again,
it's not like I don't have any hobbies either!

00:05:07.450 --> 00:05:10.010
Don't judge a book by its cover.

00:05:10.990 --> 00:05:13.790
I see. Then it won't work out.

00:05:13.790 --> 00:05:19.040
Well, I was wondering if you'd come shopping with me after school,

00:05:19.040 --> 00:05:20.090
but you seem busy—

00:05:20.090 --> 00:05:21.300
W-Wait!

00:05:23.260 --> 00:05:26.130
Bounce bounce, pass pass! Dribble...

00:05:26.880 --> 00:05:28.090
Nice shot!

00:05:28.720 --> 00:05:30.470
Ryuuko-chan's a starter candidate!

00:05:31.810 --> 00:05:33.270
Niwa-kun!

00:05:33.270 --> 00:05:35.390
Bicycle squeak, squeak...

00:05:39.060 --> 00:05:40.610
They're both so tempting!

00:05:41.270 --> 00:05:42.980
You should choose your practice over riding with me.

00:05:42.980 --> 00:05:44.280
What're you buying?

00:05:45.360 --> 00:05:52.200
My cousin's kind of having a birthday party, so I thought I should get her something.

00:05:52.200 --> 00:05:54.080
Your cousin... as in Touwa-san?

00:05:54.080 --> 00:05:55.000
Yeah.

00:05:55.000 --> 00:05:58.250
I don't know what to get, so I thought maybe you could help me.

00:05:58.250 --> 00:05:59.500
What?

00:05:59.500 --> 00:06:00.750
Huh?

00:06:00.750 --> 00:06:04.710
Ryuuko-san has just become too busy.

00:06:04.710 --> 00:06:06.780
Do you hate Erio or something?

00:06:06.780 --> 00:06:08.470
Nope.

00:06:08.470 --> 00:06:10.640
I don't know her enough to hate her.

00:06:12.600 --> 00:06:15.640
But you're angry about something.

00:06:15.640 --> 00:06:17.310
Am not!

00:06:17.500 --> 00:06:21.560
It would take something huge to anger the peace-loving Ryuuko-san!

00:06:31.450 --> 00:06:37.330
To be honest, this unreasonable anger is directed towards you.

00:06:38.090 --> 00:06:39.460
What? Me?

00:06:39.460 --> 00:06:42.920
It has been determined that Niwa-kun lacks delicacy.

00:06:42.920 --> 00:06:44.960
You're <i>delicurry!</i>

00:06:46.460 --> 00:06:50.470
So, I shouldn't expect you to come with me after school?

00:06:50.470 --> 00:06:52.300
Unfortunately, disappointingly,

00:06:52.300 --> 00:06:54.560
there's no chance.

00:06:54.560 --> 00:06:57.710
And it's Ryuuko!

00:06:57.710 --> 00:07:00.190
Got it? Got it?

00:07:03.780 --> 00:07:07.100
Maekawa-san spoke to me after school.

00:07:07.100 --> 00:07:09.620
Hey, something troubling you?

00:07:09.620 --> 00:07:11.320
It's not a big deal, but...

00:07:11.320 --> 00:07:15.330
Ask for Mae-emon's help when you're in trouble.

00:07:16.570 --> 00:07:19.950
Fine. Help me, Mae-emon!

00:07:20.480 --> 00:07:23.480
Long story short, this conversation happened before...

00:07:27.420 --> 00:07:28.710
Thank you!

00:07:31.630 --> 00:07:33.700
<i>Warabimochi</i> for a birthday present?

00:07:33.700 --> 00:07:38.470
Don't worry, the chance of Touwa shedding tears of joy is over seventy percent!

00:07:38.470 --> 00:07:40.980
Excuse me for a second.

00:07:47.090 --> 00:07:49.610
Oh, it's a plastic bottle rocket.

00:07:50.050 --> 00:07:54.490
A middle-aged man with odd earrings launches them from that closed school.

00:07:54.490 --> 00:07:56.370
Maybe he's been laid off.

00:07:57.320 --> 00:07:59.250
You sure know a lot about him. Is he someone you know?

00:07:59.700 --> 00:08:02.670
No, does it matter?

00:08:05.330 --> 00:08:06.500
Maekawa-san?

00:08:06.500 --> 00:08:09.210
Too much blood rushed to my head.

00:08:09.210 --> 00:08:11.550
I must be tired from lack of sleep.

00:08:11.550 --> 00:08:12.850
Studying for finals?

00:08:12.850 --> 00:08:15.760
No, my night job is too exhausting.

00:08:16.510 --> 00:08:18.010
Night job?

00:08:23.140 --> 00:08:25.690
You seem to have a lot of jobs.

00:08:25.690 --> 00:08:27.860
Is there something you want to buy?

00:08:27.860 --> 00:08:29.230
Of course.

00:08:29.230 --> 00:08:32.030
I want to get a moped and a license for it.

00:08:32.030 --> 00:08:35.530
I'll give you a ride when I get them.

00:08:35.530 --> 00:08:37.780
Nah, we shouldn't ride double.

00:08:37.780 --> 00:08:41.450
I hear it's legal to carry baggage.

00:08:41.450 --> 00:08:42.910
I'll consider your offer.

00:08:46.380 --> 00:08:48.040
I'm ho—

00:08:49.040 --> 00:08:51.170
Ma-chan!

00:08:53.050 --> 00:08:54.430
Would you like dinner?

00:08:54.510 --> 00:08:55.930
Or a bath?

00:08:56.010 --> 00:08:57.430
Or rather...

00:08:57.760 --> 00:09:00.430
E-ri-o?

00:09:00.430 --> 00:09:03.140
Don't offer your own daughter!

00:09:03.140 --> 00:09:05.230
You're no fun!

00:09:05.230 --> 00:09:07.150
Come on, Erio.

00:09:07.150 --> 00:09:09.110
Say, "Welcome home, Daddy!"

00:09:09.110 --> 00:09:09.900
Don't say "Daddy"!

00:09:11.980 --> 00:09:14.360
Welcome... home.

00:09:15.450 --> 00:09:18.870
What's with... your hairstyles?

00:09:19.870 --> 00:09:20.620
What do you think?

00:09:20.620 --> 00:09:22.750
I think something is wrong with you.

00:09:22.750 --> 00:09:26.460
I recreated Erio's hairstyle from her elementary school days.

00:09:26.460 --> 00:09:28.670
Why are you wearing it too?

00:09:30.840 --> 00:09:35.130
My inner child made me do it!

00:09:35.130 --> 00:09:36.880
Twin tails on a forty-year-old.

00:09:36.880 --> 00:09:38.640
By popular demand!

00:09:38.640 --> 00:09:43.520
I also used to run around with this hairstyle!

00:09:43.520 --> 00:09:45.020
I did.

00:09:45.020 --> 00:09:46.770
I sure did!

00:09:47.520 --> 00:09:50.400
Mom... in the past?

00:09:52.070 --> 00:09:53.480
Can you imagine it?

00:09:53.480 --> 00:09:54.280
No.

00:09:54.280 --> 00:09:56.280
It's not so different from what you see in the mirror.

00:09:59.030 --> 00:10:00.830
Remember, Erio.

00:10:00.830 --> 00:10:04.410
From now on, you should live a life where you look in a mirror every day.

00:10:05.000 --> 00:10:09.330
That way, you'll be loved by a lot more people.

00:10:13.300 --> 00:10:18.510
The chance of Mako-chan falling back in love with me from that exchange is over seventy percent!

00:10:18.510 --> 00:10:19.470
I never did in the first place.

00:10:21.640 --> 00:10:24.680
Okay, let's get ready for dinner.

00:10:24.680 --> 00:10:30.310
I wonder when you'll finally become a housewife.

00:10:30.310 --> 00:10:34.620
I'm sorry, but I like your cooking.

00:10:34.620 --> 00:10:38.130
What? Does that mean you want me to make you miso soup every morning?

00:10:38.130 --> 00:10:39.630
Don't over-interpret.

00:10:39.630 --> 00:10:41.810
Oh, so you're asking me to take it one step at a time?

00:10:41.810 --> 00:10:44.890
Does that mean you'd rather pick your own wife instead of having an arranged marriage?

00:10:44.890 --> 00:10:47.850
Please don't get ahead of yourself.

00:10:47.850 --> 00:10:50.270
Nurararara!

00:10:51.880 --> 00:10:52.960
The cousin.

00:10:52.960 --> 00:10:53.500
Huh?

00:10:55.050 --> 00:10:57.630
I have to talk to you about something. Come.

00:10:58.800 --> 00:11:02.140
Sure, I do too.

00:11:13.060 --> 00:11:14.770
Hello, Touwa residence.

00:11:15.980 --> 00:11:18.610
I'm doing fine. You?

00:11:18.610 --> 00:11:19.950
Mako-kun!

00:11:20.780 --> 00:11:23.740
Troubling me? Meme-san?

00:11:23.740 --> 00:11:24.910
Not at all.

00:11:24.910 --> 00:11:25.740
Who is it?
Not at all.

00:11:25.740 --> 00:11:26.790
My parents.

00:11:26.790 --> 00:11:28.660
Perfect timing!

00:11:28.660 --> 00:11:31.670
Let me talk to them!

00:11:31.830 --> 00:11:34.710
Heroin! Cocaine!

00:11:34.710 --> 00:11:37.420
Brother? No hanging up allowed!

00:11:39.420 --> 00:11:40.420
Wait.

00:11:41.840 --> 00:11:45.430
Under what circumstances do you roll yourself up in that futon?

00:11:45.430 --> 00:11:47.970
I wanted to calm down for our conversation.

00:11:47.970 --> 00:11:51.230
Let's try calming down the way humans do.

00:11:51.230 --> 00:11:53.770
You're still rolling futons around you?

00:11:53.770 --> 00:11:55.560
It calms me down the most.

00:12:04.320 --> 00:12:05.370
Here.

00:12:05.370 --> 00:12:08.450
Present-ish thing for your birthday-ish event.

00:12:17.540 --> 00:12:19.000
Thank you.

00:12:19.510 --> 00:12:22.380
It's a celebration, after all.

00:12:22.380 --> 00:12:23.380
I'm glad.

00:12:25.340 --> 00:12:27.850
I really...

00:12:28.470 --> 00:12:30.220
love it.

00:12:35.770 --> 00:12:37.770
So, what did you want to talk about?

00:12:40.280 --> 00:12:43.150
Uh, before...

00:12:43.150 --> 00:12:46.450
I tell Mom...

00:12:46.450 --> 00:12:49.330
I wanted to... ask the cousin.

00:12:53.410 --> 00:12:54.790
What is it?

00:12:56.670 --> 00:12:58.040
I want to work!

00:12:58.040 --> 00:12:59.040
Huh?

00:12:59.040 --> 00:13:03.130
I want to rejoin society.

00:13:03.130 --> 00:13:07.300
Maybe... I think...

00:13:08.050 --> 00:13:09.560
I guess.

00:13:17.770 --> 00:13:20.730
Five days after Erio's declaration of a return to society,

00:13:20.730 --> 00:13:24.990
Meme-san gave us a half-hearted "I have no problem with that,"

00:13:25.400 --> 00:13:30.530
a "you should get a nice haircut then," and a recommendation for a hair stylist.

00:13:38.000 --> 00:13:39.000
Baseball.

00:13:39.710 --> 00:13:41.050
You like baseball?

00:13:42.050 --> 00:13:43.800
Were you in any clubs?

00:13:44.670 --> 00:13:45.800
Astronomy club...

00:13:46.880 --> 00:13:50.800
would've been nice, but I didn't join any clubs.

00:13:51.970 --> 00:13:53.020
Fine.

00:13:57.020 --> 00:13:58.650
How would you like it?

00:13:58.650 --> 00:14:00.900
I want it nice.

00:14:00.900 --> 00:14:02.480
Want to leave it to me, then?

00:14:02.480 --> 00:14:03.400
Yup, yup, yup.

00:14:04.150 --> 00:14:06.030
What's your name?

00:14:06.030 --> 00:14:08.990
Erio... Touwa.

00:14:08.990 --> 00:14:10.320
Touwa?

00:14:10.320 --> 00:14:12.870
Wasn't that Jojo-san's last name?

00:14:13.740 --> 00:14:18.120
Jojo... Ah! That's my mom.

00:14:20.040 --> 00:14:21.460
Oh?

00:14:23.000 --> 00:14:25.210
You're cute, just like your mom.

00:14:25.210 --> 00:14:27.260
Name...

00:14:28.260 --> 00:14:30.720
What's... your name?

00:14:30.720 --> 00:14:32.430
Oh, me?

00:14:32.430 --> 00:14:34.010
Ooi Tooe.

00:14:34.010 --> 00:14:36.520
My friends call me "Toeic".

00:14:40.600 --> 00:14:42.190
Who's that boyfriend of yours?

00:14:46.490 --> 00:14:48.110
Right side!

00:14:48.110 --> 00:14:51.070
No, I'm her cousin!

00:14:51.490 --> 00:14:53.490
Oh, you're that...

00:14:54.950 --> 00:15:01.250
The guy with the reputation for leering at his favorite aunt, Makoto-kun, right?

00:15:03.290 --> 00:15:07.970
Did she spread that lie so thoroughly that I have a reputation for it now?

00:15:09.090 --> 00:15:10.510
Is it too short?

00:15:10.510 --> 00:15:11.800
Not really.

00:15:11.800 --> 00:15:16.010
To be honest, I can't even tell the difference.

00:15:16.640 --> 00:15:18.350
Anyway, it freshened you up.

00:15:21.560 --> 00:15:24.480
Okay, shall we get to your job interview?

00:15:24.480 --> 00:15:25.190
Yeah.

00:15:28.740 --> 00:15:34.990
You still have other options besides working, like attending high school part-time.

00:15:36.490 --> 00:15:38.870
I already dropped out, so I can't.

00:15:39.330 --> 00:15:40.410
Banned.

00:15:43.380 --> 00:15:48.380
Why does she keep her school uniform in her room, then?

00:15:52.510 --> 00:15:57.010
She was rejected on the spot, Erio said briefly.

00:15:58.520 --> 00:16:00.350
You're that girl, right?

00:16:00.350 --> 00:16:02.850
The one who walks around the city in a futon.

00:16:02.850 --> 00:16:05.650
You're still not going to school?

00:16:05.650 --> 00:16:08.900
You're kind of famous around the city.

00:16:08.900 --> 00:16:12.030
I can't hire a weird person, can I?

00:16:12.030 --> 00:16:15.280
I doubt you'll find work anywhere else.

00:16:16.660 --> 00:16:20.700
The first step of her return to society was a stumble.

00:16:20.700 --> 00:16:25.330
It may already be too late for Erio to resume a normal life.

00:16:26.500 --> 00:16:27.670
Erio.

00:16:31.420 --> 00:16:33.050
Want to go shopping?

00:16:36.720 --> 00:16:40.470
We've already come this far, so let's have some fun
in the city before going home.

00:16:40.470 --> 00:16:42.060
We can go eat something too.

00:16:48.690 --> 00:16:50.190
Are you hungry?

00:16:50.190 --> 00:16:51.360
Yeah.

00:16:51.360 --> 00:16:52.610
What do you want to eat?

00:16:52.610 --> 00:16:53.780
Pizza.

00:16:53.780 --> 00:16:55.070
Would a family restaurant do?

00:16:55.990 --> 00:16:57.070
Yeah.

00:16:58.700 --> 00:17:00.330
Erio is still fine.

00:17:00.700 --> 00:17:05.120
She's slowly being pulled back into reality by the gravity of society.

00:17:05.120 --> 00:17:07.290
That's exactly why she decided to work.

00:17:08.290 --> 00:17:09.710
We're home!

00:17:09.710 --> 00:17:10.920
We're home.

00:17:16.340 --> 00:17:17.340
Wait.

00:17:18.680 --> 00:17:20.310
Take off your shoes first.

00:17:23.680 --> 00:17:24.940
You may enter now.

00:17:26.350 --> 00:17:28.770
Go wash your hands. We're having snacks.

00:17:29.610 --> 00:17:30.230
Okay!

00:17:32.360 --> 00:17:33.490
She really believed me?

00:17:33.940 --> 00:17:36.990
Eri-chan's gullibility worries me!

00:17:39.370 --> 00:17:41.410
Welcome home.

00:17:42.870 --> 00:17:44.710
Did you catch a cold?

00:17:44.710 --> 00:17:49.420
No, I was just spacing out. I stayed in the bath too long.

00:17:49.960 --> 00:17:52.250
Erio failed her interview.

00:17:52.250 --> 00:17:55.050
I guess she would.

00:17:55.050 --> 00:17:55.970
Yeah.

00:17:58.260 --> 00:17:59.430
That girl...

00:17:59.430 --> 00:18:04.310
seems to be concerned about spending too much money on high school.

00:18:06.020 --> 00:18:08.270
It does cost a lot of money, but...

00:18:12.440 --> 00:18:14.190
Did something happen?

00:18:15.190 --> 00:18:17.280
Well, you know,

00:18:18.030 --> 00:18:22.160
when you joke around saying "I'm a god",

00:18:22.160 --> 00:18:27.080
and one day people really start worshiping you,

00:18:27.080 --> 00:18:29.290
it's troubling, you know?

00:18:30.540 --> 00:18:33.800
Did you meet someone in your fan club?

00:18:38.300 --> 00:18:39.180
U-Um...

00:18:40.970 --> 00:18:45.220
How's it feel to have a cutie aunt lying on your lap?

00:18:45.220 --> 00:18:47.430
It feels like a giant clam.

00:18:48.690 --> 00:18:51.100
So, it's a rather juicy situation.

00:18:52.730 --> 00:18:55.280
Hey, you freaky pervert!

00:18:57.190 --> 00:19:00.030
Sorry, I got carried away!

00:19:02.990 --> 00:19:07.250
How do you get so pumped up after looking so depressed?

00:19:07.250 --> 00:19:10.080
Oh, listen well, Mak-kyun.

00:19:11.330 --> 00:19:12.540
What is it?

00:19:12.540 --> 00:19:16.130
I know a place that might hire Erio.

00:19:18.090 --> 00:19:20.300
Why didn't you tell us?

00:19:20.300 --> 00:19:22.140
I just found it today.

00:19:22.140 --> 00:19:24.850
Erio will know the place.

00:19:28.180 --> 00:19:30.100
Would you like to sleep with us, Erio?

00:19:32.520 --> 00:19:33.360
Where are the snacks?

00:19:34.060 --> 00:19:36.860
You're the snack!

00:19:42.820 --> 00:19:49.750
I wonder if there's anything in this world that could trouble her enough to keep her melancholy.

00:19:49.750 --> 00:19:51.710
Save me!

00:19:51.710 --> 00:19:54.750
Okay, after I finish watching the credits.

00:20:01.220 --> 00:20:04.660
No matter how much you work, life will never get any easier.

00:20:04.660 --> 00:20:08.680
Being wrapped in the futon is the right way of spending my day off.

00:20:13.190 --> 00:20:14.150
Morning.

00:20:14.150 --> 00:20:16.190
Hey, good morning.

00:20:16.190 --> 00:20:17.400
Hold this.

00:20:19.780 --> 00:20:20.940
Where are we going?

00:20:22.950 --> 00:20:24.570
The candy shop in the shopping district.

00:20:25.170 --> 00:20:28.580
Your job is to replace the granny there.

00:20:35.630 --> 00:20:37.250
Must be to alert her to customers.

00:20:41.920 --> 00:20:44.350
Wanna go inside?

00:20:44.350 --> 00:20:45.880
Yeah.

00:20:52.100 --> 00:20:53.690
Here?

00:20:57.400 --> 00:20:59.230
Granny?

00:20:59.230 --> 00:21:00.650
Yes, yes.

00:21:00.780 --> 00:21:03.860
I was just about to come out.

00:21:04.320 --> 00:21:06.530
Uh... good morning.

00:21:06.530 --> 00:21:07.570
Long time.

00:21:07.570 --> 00:21:09.450
They know each other?

00:21:11.160 --> 00:21:12.450
Who are you, again?

00:21:15.920 --> 00:21:20.750
The Earth's gravity sure is taking its toll on me.

00:21:23.970 --> 00:21:26.340
Well, thanks for waking me.

00:21:27.840 --> 00:21:30.600
Oh! Elliott!

00:21:30.600 --> 00:21:32.720
No, Erio.

00:21:33.270 --> 00:21:37.520
Elliott and Meme's kid, so Elliott is fine!

00:21:38.020 --> 00:21:39.110
Huh?

00:21:39.110 --> 00:21:42.730
Who are you? Sorry if I just forgot who you are.

00:21:42.730 --> 00:21:44.990
Although that would never happen!

00:21:44.990 --> 00:21:47.780
I'm Niwa Makoto, Erio's cousin.

00:21:47.780 --> 00:21:49.240
Yes, the cousin.

00:21:49.780 --> 00:21:52.580
Oh! Shouji's son!

00:21:52.580 --> 00:21:55.460
Yes. Do you know my—

00:21:55.460 --> 00:21:57.710
I know him very well.

00:21:58.170 --> 00:22:01.800
He was a guy loved more by animals than people.

00:22:01.800 --> 00:22:03.840
The exact opposite of Meme.

00:22:03.840 --> 00:22:06.170
Right, and lately—

00:22:06.170 --> 00:22:06.930
Um...

00:22:06.930 --> 00:22:08.130
What do you want?

00:22:09.640 --> 00:22:12.930
About Erio working here... more like helping out...

00:22:12.930 --> 00:22:15.140
Oh, right.

00:22:15.140 --> 00:22:18.140
That's right. I heard from Meme.

00:22:18.140 --> 00:22:19.230
I'll hire her.

00:22:20.520 --> 00:22:27.700
Great, you finished talking, so it's my turn. What do you say?

00:22:27.700 --> 00:22:28.490
Go ahead.

00:22:28.490 --> 00:22:29.990
Animals.

00:22:29.990 --> 00:22:30.990
Y-Yes?

00:22:31.660 --> 00:22:35.790
The animals in this city are disappearing one after another.

00:22:35.790 --> 00:22:38.790
Abduction.

00:22:39.330 --> 00:22:43.550
I don't know anything about that,
but maybe it's the animal shelters?

00:22:45.050 --> 00:22:47.550
It's <i>cattle mutilation</i>.

00:22:48.090 --> 00:22:49.220
I'm certain of it.

00:22:49.220 --> 00:22:52.180
<i>Cattle</i>... that thing, right?

00:22:52.180 --> 00:22:54.560
Mutilation of animals by aliens.

00:22:54.560 --> 00:23:00.480
But I thought that was already proven to be from natural causes, such as other animals.

00:23:01.150 --> 00:23:03.730
Well, I'm next.

00:23:05.530 --> 00:23:06.150
Wh-What?

00:23:06.150 --> 00:23:10.410
I'm going to become a victim of <i>cattle mutilation</i> soon.

00:23:12.240 --> 00:23:15.040
One of these people again.

00:23:15.040 --> 00:23:16.370
It's as if...

00:23:16.750 --> 00:23:21.540
as if the Erio from this April had suddenly become elderly.

00:23:23.250 --> 00:23:25.300
Okay then, let's say it out loud,

00:23:25.300 --> 00:23:29.630
in a polite sarcasm perfect for these situations. Ready, go.

00:23:30.510 --> 00:23:32.800
Fine... I guess.

00:23:35.470 --> 00:23:37.020
And so,

00:23:37.020 --> 00:23:41.140
Erio will be working at the Tamura Shop.

00:25:12.940 --> 00:25:16.070
Forty years old!: -4,000,000.

00:25:16.070 --> 00:25:19.410
Becoming a member of the Touwa family, adolescence waning: -1.

00:25:19.410 --> 00:25:21.410
Dango munch-munch: +1,000,000.

00:25:21.410 --> 00:25:23.160
Certified <i>delicurry</i>: -1.

00:25:23.160 --> 00:25:25.420
Spinny-spin around Mako-kun: +2,000,000.

00:25:25.420 --> 00:25:28.750
Accompanying Erio in her job search, in vain: -3.

00:25:28.750 --> 00:25:31.210
Lick, lickity lick, lick, lickity: +1,000,000.

00:25:31.210 --> 00:25:32.130
-5!

00:25:32.130 --> 00:25:34.880
Current happiness points total: +/- 0.

00:25:34.880 --> 00:25:37.390
Current adolescence points total: -9.

00:25:37.390 --> 00:25:41.060
Next time: Ryuu"ko"-san's Kind of Vaguely.
